WEBVTT

00:06:29.036 --> 00:06:31.516
at a food manufacturer called Cook.

00:06:31.556 --> 00:06:34.196
They have something called
the "Dream Academy."

00:06:34.596 --> 00:06:38.156
And in this academy, their colleagues
can explore any career

00:06:38.196 --> 00:06:39.636
that they're intrigued by,

00:06:39.676 --> 00:06:42.036
in or out of the organization,

00:06:42.036 --> 00:06:44.716
and even rediscover abandoned ambitions.

00:06:44.756 --> 00:06:47.236
It could be to try stand-up comedy,

00:06:47.236 --> 00:06:49.036
to write their first children's book,

00:06:49.076 --> 00:06:51.036
to move from marketing to finance,

00:06:51.076 --> 00:06:52.636
become the CEO.

00:06:52.636 --> 00:06:54.316
Nothing is off the table.

00:06:54.876 --> 00:06:56.756
One employee said,

00:06:56.796 --> 00:06:59.636
"The Dream Academy
didn't open doors for me.